"``ARDUINO_GIGA``/``NICLA_VISION``/``PORTENTA_H7``/``NANO_RP2040_CONNECT``/``NANO_33_BLE_SENSE``,"
" with refreshed UVC binaries. (`42a646b63 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/42a646b63>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**번들 OpenMV 펌웨어:** ``OPENMV2``/``3``/``4``/``4P``/``PT``, ``OPENMV_RT1060``,"
" "
"``ARDUINO_GIGA``/``NICLA_VISION``/``PORTENTA_H7``/``NANO_RP2040_CONNECT``/``NANO_33_BLE_SENSE``\\"
" 를 포함하여 지원되는 모든 보드에 대해 4.5.8 -> 4.5.9로 업데이트되었으며, 새로 고쳐진 UVC 바이너리를 포함합니다. "
